<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak 96 net profit drops to SKK 1.29 bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak 96 net profit drops to SKK 1.29 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia's sole crude oil refiner, Slovnaft a.s., said on Thursday it posted an unconsolidated, unaudited net profit of 1.29 billion crowns in 1996, down from 1.83 billion crowns in 1995.</p>
<p>Slovnaft said in a statement that its pre-tax profit fell to 2.307 billion crowns in 1996, from 3.27 billion crowns in 1995.</p>
<p>It added that it would propose paying a 20 crown per share dividend on 1996 profits, up from an 18 crown dividend the previous year.</p>
</text>
